{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7393f8fe39b1777ee5ed109332af0f2d0c47142b8b85e275fb8ceb1f24fcc8c9", "ja": "（今日は劇場のアイドル達が出演する、ファンタジー\nドラマの撮影。杏奈は、お城の騎士役だけど……）", "zh": "（剧场的偶像们今天有奇幻电视剧的拍摄行程。\n杏奈演的是城堡的骑士……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "608c0d5654b73aeca33b9fe911275e1406f78bb39d136e78166aa5cd71581e0d", "ja": "「アンナ、ずっと信じてたよ……！\n優しいミキ姫が、魔王になるはずがない、って……」", "zh": "「杏奈一直都深信着……\n心地善良的美希公主是不可能变成魔王的……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "514a094e7cde9e68cb533407447e6b6557e168789656b08d614243fa63674c9a", "ja": "「ツムギ姫、心配しないで！　アンナたちが\n必ず大魔王を倒して、平和を取り戻すから……！」", "zh": "「小䌷公主，不用担心！杏奈我们\n一定会打败大魔王，让世界恢复和平……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2bec3363f32f095524deb22e26830d41078a6fe7dc1bb6800eca9f9ffdc7151a", "ja": "杏奈、お疲れさま。セリフの練習か？\n頑張ってるな！", "zh": "杏奈，辛苦了。你在练习拍戏的台词吗？\n真努力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "0306f620a8c362fa9031d6b528560db525cc47f977c71c469df011eb11e1bba5", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}さん……。\nう、うん……そう……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生……\n嗯、嗯……没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "50a0d6811bdddd61a767aa5065b6c4371d797253bc1b64dc5fecb38e06a3dfe2", "ja": "杏奈……お城の騎士、だから……\nセリフ、カッコよく言えないと……決まらない……。", "zh": "杏奈……是城堡的骑士……\n说台词时不帅一点……可不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0c7d209dc20e28b1dd4a4a4616df1496d17a4aa5a2316d0333b991ab62126816", "ja": "そうだな。でも今の感じは、役に合ってたと思う。\nその調子で、本番も頑張ろう！", "zh": "也是，我觉得刚刚那样就相当符合角色了，\n正式开拍时也照这个样子加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "3c3a6fd47f37c4defdabd18f56be52a0dea37e0223e28e9ac9d74ce293de2c3f", "ja": "ホント……？　{$P$}さん、\nありがとう……。杏奈、がんばる……！", "zh": "真的吗……？{$P$}先生，\n谢谢你……杏奈会加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "09f49ae0157e6a4270bf5eb230eecdd6e5d298f1d4e2ae2e742dae8c17bce06b", "ja": "このドラマ……衣装も、お話も、ファンタジーRPG\nみたいで……杏奈、すっごく好き……だから……♪", "zh": "这部戏……服装跟故事都像奇幻RPG一样……\n杏奈非常喜欢……所以……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "b657ce097f188f581ad72417d3d8f89737202b596c4b9ef801a711f4e346c1e0", "ja": "がんばって、お姫さまを助けて……勇者たちと\n一緒に……大魔王を、倒します……！", "zh": "杏奈会努力救出公主……\n和勇者她们一起……打倒大魔王……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1010_p", "source_sha256": "86505fb8bacb2b40baad05832732d9b4439b6d89b1f484389ff3e5fede1800b1", "ja": "はは、そうだな。その意気だ！", "zh": "哈哈，没错，这么积极就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "f06ebfa694190007962145e4a733921e8b379bf8248f15c73b64b9d17fa18f1c", "ja": "あ……えっと、{$P$}さん……。\nひとつだけ……お願い、聞いてくれますか……？", "zh": "啊……那个，{$P$}先生……\n杏奈有个请求……你愿意听听吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1012_p", "source_sha256": "861b69904a57ffea5affe6a6253b0ccec2d38bb86d2b9b8bd22d0f1ba263b7ef", "ja": "お願い？　いいけど、なんだ？", "zh": "请求？好啊，是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "c7c053c88332c9451172070e0e9879add8ee23c1fd101b6c5640e01b71172ce2", "ja": "あのね……セリフの、練習……\n一緒に、やってほしいの……ダメ、かな……？", "zh": "那个……演戏的练习……\n杏奈想要你陪人家一起……可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "26862c8e7d40c25683f4bf08a5889bbe1737a79a9db4c9a998edc1ace373bb7a", "ja": "杏奈、ひとりだと……うまく、イメージできなくて……\n……お願い、します……。", "zh": "只有杏奈自己……会抓不太到感觉……\n……拜托你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1015_p", "source_sha256": "914aa147098ee50ce203d1dafa552fcf6df8570e3b03e1802d721e8dafd72060", "ja": "台本の読み合わせか、いいぞ。でも他のところも\n見にいかないとだから、少しだけな！", "zh": "要念台词陪你练习啊，没问题。\n但我还得去看其他地方，不能太久喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "a98636a7d1277dce275aa6c794a5713b710cf7ad70cf52edd01e65fee237c310", "ja": "うん……ありがとう……！\nえっと……じゃあ、台本の……ここから、です……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你……！\n那……从这段台词……开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "4c6bc89491682079f99e6d192cbeabbfb10980df8eaf1ded4f5b9f30ff71223b", "ja": "「大魔王！　この世界を、おまえの好きにはさせない！\n勇者と、アンナたちが……絶対に、守ってみせる！」", "zh": "「大魔王！你休想对这个世界为所欲为！\n杏奈我们跟勇者……一定会守护好世界！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0e104cf773d413e15baabcd63dc205780dc18e7230a3c8f8e6a7fc77d912c088", "ja": "えーと、俺は大魔王役か……よし！\n「その威勢、いつまで続くものか……ハハハハハッ！」", "zh": "我看看，我是大魔王啊……好！\n「我倒要看看你可以嚣张到什么时候……哈哈哈哈哈！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "aaa5d9afd7680fe4646c31930b10612caa521c2f3c83c1c5745af12a00438539", "ja": "「みんな！　ここはチハヤと、\nアンナのふたりにまかせて！　……いくよ、チハヤ！」", "zh": "「各位！这里就交给千早跟杏奈吧！\n……要上啰，千早！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "935a1c9e48b1722615196184d3675847374b71c5e3f0e5e85a475e442f8200e8", "ja": "…………。\n{$P$}さん！　セリフセリフ！", "zh": "…………\n{$P$}先生！台词台词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6e8bf5145ebb1a48b62bac9e8346b85c1d4662099a2da02acdecb6caebe55a10", "ja": "え！？　チハヤ役も俺なのか！？\n「ええ、アンナ！　私たちなら、きっと……！」", "zh": "咦！？千早的角色也是我演吗！？\n「嗯，杏奈！我们一定行的……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "ec03542d33bb7e537d4da22c2ab577d2f4db4e7e55f21b944db9cfc6e8a1100a", "ja": "…………。\n{$P$}さん、次！　はいっ！", "zh": "…………\n{$P$}先生，下一句！来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1023_p", "source_sha256": "e35ce038c854fe74ba2d3efd56be176c343d34c81f130dd8e73564e84c7d10da", "ja": "ミキも俺か！？　ええっと……。\n「うんっ！　アンナとチハヤを信じるの！　あはっ☆」", "zh": "美希也是我！？我看看……\n「嗯！美希相信杏奈跟千早没问题的！啊哈☆」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0074_1024_p", "source_sha256": "144f47a607a61daf89d96b6b6084e080b131640bb623505d76877c6483682f0d", "ja": "（その後の読み合わせで、杏奈はカンをつかんだ\nようだった。俺の演技力もレベルアップした……か？）", "zh": "（杏奈好像在之后的练习抓到感觉了。\n我自己的演技也进步了……吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
